ace  The remainder of the parenchyma is soft fatty and white fibrous tissue  Section code  A B  biopsy cavity with posterior margin  C D  further sections of biopsy cavity  E  medial portion of biopsy cavity  F  nodule in lateral portion of breast  with posterior margin  G I  representative sections of tissue away from cavity  P  section of inferior portion of biopsy cavity  Q  section away from biopsy cavity  The axillary tail is dissected for lymph nodes  A representative section of each is submitted in J O  with M containing a single node  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  Arlan F Fuller Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION   report_end  , Yes.
